1111
01:09:22,389 --> 01:09:25,472
Yes, he is. Hold on.

1112
01:09:25,555 --> 01:09:27,514
- It's the Coopersmiths.
- Thank you.

1113
01:09:29,014 --> 01:09:30,930
Hello. No.

1114
