1123
01:10:19,597 --> 01:10:21,722
- Did you forget-
- Resist the temptation to scream.

1124
01:10:21,805 --> 01:10:25,097
- What Are you doing here, - you little
jewel thief? - No, I'm not a thief.

1125
01:10:25,180 --> 01:10:27,139
I- I'm suspect.
